      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Read this first\n\nThis ships **switched off**. Turn it on with the toggle at the top right only after you have run a search by hand and are happy with the result and cost.\n\nAt 8am every day it starts the same guarded funding scan used by the chat tools. If another scan is already running, the shared run workflow stops this one before it can spend anything.",
