      "name": "Read this first"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Cost note\n\nA completed scan costs about a dollar. Running every day can therefore cost roughly $30 a month. Each run records its searches and tokens in the `funding_runs` table.\n\nThe schedule uses the timezone configured in n8n.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
